cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Aircraft Detection in Satellite Imagery
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata. The NWPU VHR-10
  dataset has its own citation requirements; see README.md.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Mohamed
    given-names: Abdalrahman
    alias: Abdalrahman-git
repository-code: https://github.com/Abdalrahman-git/aircraft-detection-yolo
abstract: >-
  A single-class aircraft detector for very-high-resolution remote sensing
  imagery, built two ways and compared on equal terms: a YOLO-style detector
  written from scratch in PyTorch (CSP backbone, SPPF neck, focal and CIoU loss,
  NMS and average precision all implemented directly), and a fine-tuned
  YOLOv9-S. Both are scored by the same metric code on the same seeded split of
  the aircraft class of NWPU VHR-10.
keywords:
  - object detection
  - remote sensing
  - satellite imagery
  - YOLO
  - YOLOv9
  - PyTorch
  - NWPU VHR-10
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
